# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, and add the same
# variable in Vercel's Project Settings -> Environment Variables for
# production. Without it, the Contact page form will show a friendly
# "call or WhatsApp us" fallback instead of sending an email.

# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Add and verify the dubaisign.ae domain (Settings -> Domains) so you
#    can send mail as e.g. quotes@dubaisign.ae — without a verified
#    domain, Resend only allows sending to the account owner's own inbox.
# 3. Create an API key (API Keys -> Create API Key) and paste it below.
# 4. Update the `from` address in app/api/contact/route.ts to match your
#    verified domain.
RESEND_API_KEY=
